      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "COONDLE (4) gets the nod after a determined neck win at Broome two starts back, before failing off a wide run as the favourite at Mt Newman 3 weeks ago. He gets a big swing in his draw here, and looks ideally placed to make another winning play. KIMBERLEY CURRENCY (2) showed plenty of heart to score by a nose here 3 runs ago and has since finished third twice in a row. He will be hard to hold out here. LADY COCO (7) was well beaten here last time out, but she has a slightly better draw this time. She carries 3kg less and has a chance to put her best hoof forward. Keep safe. MARS MISSION (3) has been well supported at his last two but failed to deliver, finishing sixth at Junction a week ago. He is better than that and appeals as the value runner back on a more suitable circuit. SMART RETURN (8) has also attracted market support without delivering, finishing seventh at Junction last time. She needs to improve but can sneak into the minors.",
